User-supplied data
==================

UniDic is supplied by the user and is not distributed with Rikai-Mobile.
UniDic is licensed under GPL v2 / LGPL v2.1 / modified BSD (Copyright National
Institute for Japanese Language and Linguistics). MDict dictionaries are
supplied by the user; their original content licenses apply and they are not
redistributed by this project.

The HarmonyOS Sans SC UI font is supplied by the user (downloaded from Huawei's
HarmonyOS design resources) and is not distributed with Rikai-Mobile. It is
used under the HarmonyOS Sans Fonts License Agreement; Copyright Huawei Device
Co., Ltd.

Model binaries, UniDic files, MDict files and user data are intentionally
excluded from the repository by .gitignore.
